---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Project Preparation & Appraisal | Detailed Project Reports (DPR) — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="Comprehensive project feasibility studies, Detailed Project Report (DPR) preparation, cash flow discounting, NPV optimization, and bank appraisal documentation."
>

  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white py-10 sm:py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
        Project Advisory
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
        Project Preparation & Appraisal
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Transforming industrial vision into rigorous, bankable Detailed Project Reports (DPR) and cash-flow models.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-5 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        
        <blockquote class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 rounded-r-xl">
          <p class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 italic">
            “Well Begun is half Done”
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-1 text-xs font-bold text-red-600 uppercase tracking-wide">
            — Aristotle
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          Project Preparation and Appraisal
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          Though every business is ultimately run on the ground, it's the strength of the financial papers and its presentation which helps investors and bankers make their mind regarding extending exposure to the firm.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          We undertake comprehensive feasibility study of new project of our clients by discounting future cash flows and advising clients on the viability of their investments. We also suggest remedial changes in the project if it is a negative NPV project. We also provide services to prepare Detailed Project Report for our clients. Our proprietary financial modeling tools and templates coupled with our knowledge makes our project report stand out among its peers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Key Questions We Initiate:</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200"><strong>What for:</strong> Project objectives</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200"><strong>How:</strong> Process & resources</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200"><strong>Who:</strong> Stakeholders & partners</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200"><strong>When:</strong> Time milestones</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200"><strong>Where:</strong> Site location</div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200"><strong>What:</strong> Core activity</div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Systematic Approach in Project Preparation:</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">1. Project Need Analysis</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Factors considered are problem, solutions, beneficiaries and decisions. The decision to take up the project lies on how these factors interact.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">2. Problem Formulation and Statement of Problem</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Detailed research of the problem, scope, intervention areas, and expected outcomes hypothesized.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">3. Project Planning</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Preparation of comprehensive activity charts, timelines, milestone calendars, and coordination points.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">4. Project Budgeting</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Cost category budgets (materials, capital expenditure, administration) and activity budgets with multi-year inflation assumptions.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">5. Multi-Pillar Feasibility Analysis</h4>
            <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 list-disc list-inside mt-1 space-y-1">
              <li>Management Appraisal & Governance</li>
              <li>Technical Feasibility & Engineering</li>
              <li>Financial Feasibility & NPV/IRR/DSCR</li>
              <li>Commercial & Market Appraisal</li>
              <li>Economic Feasibility</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">6. Implementation & Operational Rollout</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Scheduling operational activities one by one and establishing functional relationships.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">7. Monitoring and Periodical Evaluation</h4>
            <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mt-1">Observing progress, tracking deviations from planned performance, and executing milestone control actions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            Commission a Project Report →
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/project" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
